rtant;}.cmpwelcomeprpstxt{font-size: 11px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;text-align: left !important;font-family: \"Calibri\" !important;}.cmpbox:dir(rtl) .cmpwelcomeprpstxt:not(.cmpcenter), .cmpbox[dir=\"rtl\"] .cmpwelcomeprpstxt:not(.cmpcenter){text-align: right !important;}","foundLang":"EN","seperateDomain":false,"strWebsite":"Travian Games GmbH","verGVLv3":183,"verGVLvca2":210,"pubcc":"DE","compresscookie":1,"storecookie":1,"storels":1,"showCompany":0,"boolWCAG":1,"boolEnableGatekeeper":0,"boolHighlightFirstButton":0,"boolTransitionEnabled":1,"boolShowLayerPolicyPage":0,"strDontShowLayer":"","boolShowTvIntegrationLink":0,"boolTVDisableQRCode":0,"customLang":[{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_att","strText":"We collect certain information concerning your device, IP address, and usage to analyze the performance and the functionality of the app. Your data may be shared with and processed by up to [link=vendors][vendorcount] third-party providers[\/link] for these purposes.","intTextVersion":99838},{"strLang":"DE","strType":"txt_preview","strText":"Durch die Aktivierung dieser Inhalte k\u00f6nnen Ihre personenbezogenen Daten verarbeitet und Cookies gesetzt werden.","intTextVersion":214001},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_preview","strText":"By enabling this content, your personal data may be processed and cookies may be set.","intTextVersion":214002},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cb_preview","strText":"Always accept","intTextVersion":213991},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt","strText":"We use cookies and similar technologies to process personal and device data for purposes such as website functionality, analytics, personalization, and advertising. You can accept or reject non-essential cookies and manage your preferences at any time. For more information about the technologies we use and the purposes of processing, please review the detailed settings below as well as our privacy policy.","intTextVersion":277524},{"strLang":"DE","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99874},{"strLang":"DE","strType":"txt","strText":"Wir verwenden Cookies und \u00e4hnliche Technologien, um personenbezogene Daten und Ger\u00e4tedaten f\u00fcr Zwecke wie Website-Funktionalit\u00e4t, Analysen, Personalisierung und Werbung zu verarbeiten. Sie k\u00f6nnen nicht notwendige Cookies akzeptieren oder ablehnen und Ihre Einstellungen jederzeit anpassen. Weitere Informationen zu den von uns verwendeten Technologien und den Verarbeitungszwecken finden Sie in den detaillierten Einstellungen unten sowie in unserer Datenschutzerkl\u00e4rung.","intTextVersion":277523},{"strLang":"ES","strType":"txt","strText":"Utilizamos cookies y tecnolog\u00edas similares para procesar datos personales y del dispositivo con fines tales como el funcionamiento del sitio web, an\u00e1lisis, personalizaci\u00f3n y publicidad. Puede aceptar o rechazar las cookies no esenciales y gestionar sus preferencias en cualquier momento. Para obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre las tecnolog\u00edas que utilizamos y los fines del procesamiento, consulte la configuraci\u00f3n detallada a continuaci\u00f3n, as\u00ed como nuestra pol\u00edtica de privacidad.","intTextVersion":277525},{"strLang":"FR","strType":"txt","strText":"Nous utilisons des cookies et des technologies similaires pour traiter vos donn\u00e9es personnelles et celles de votre appareil, notamment pour le fonctionnement du site web, l&#39;analyse d&#39;audience, la personnalisation et la publicit\u00e9. Vous pouvez accepter ou refuser les cookies non essentiels et g\u00e9rer vos pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences \u00e0 tout moment. Pour plus d&#39;informations sur les technologies que nous utilisons et les finalit\u00e9s du traitement, veuillez consulter les param\u00e8tres d\u00e9taill\u00e9s ci-dessous ainsi que notre politique de confidentialit\u00e9.","intTextVersion":277526},{"strLang":"IT","strType":"txt","strText":"Utilizziamo cookie e tecnologie simili per elaborare dati personali e del dispositivo per finalit\u00e0 quali funzionalit\u00e0 del sito web, analisi, personalizzazione e pubblicit\u00e0. \u00c8 possibile accettare o rifiutare i cookie non essenziali e gestire le proprie preferenze in qualsiasi momento. Per ulteriori informazioni sulle tecnologie che utilizziamo e sulle finalit\u00e0 del trattamento, si prega di consultare le impostazioni dettagliate di seguito, nonch\u00e9 la nostra informativa sulla privacy.","intTextVersion":277514},{"strLang":"SV","strType":"txt","strText":"Vi anv\u00e4nder cookies och liknande tekniker f\u00f6r att behandla personuppgifter och enhetsuppgifter f\u00f6r \u00e4ndam\u00e5l som webbplatsfunktionalitet, analys, personalisering och annonsering. Du kan acceptera eller avvisa icke-n\u00f6dv\u00e4ndiga cookies och hantera dina inst\u00e4llningar n\u00e4r som helst. F\u00f6r mer information om de tekniker vi anv\u00e4nder och syftena med behandlingen, v\u00e4nligen granska de detaljerade inst\u00e4llningarna nedan samt v\u00e5r integritetspolicy.","intTextVersion":277527},{"strLang":"BG","strType":"txt","strText":"\u0418\u0437\u043f\u043e\u043b\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0435 \u201e\u0431\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0432\u0438\u0442\u043a\u0438\u201c \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0431\u043d\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438, \u0437\u0430 \u0434\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0435 \u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0438 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0438 \u0438 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0438 \u043e\u0442 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u0437\u0430 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u043a\u0430\u0442\u043e \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442 \u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0435\u0431\u0441\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0430, \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0438, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0430. \u041c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0435\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0442\u0445\u0432\u044a\u0440\u043b\u044f\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u0441\u044a\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u201e\u0431\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0432\u0438\u0442\u043a\u0438\u201c \u0438 \u0434\u0430 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043f\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f\u0442\u0430 \u0441\u0438 \u043f\u043e \u0432\u0441\u044f\u043a\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435. \u0417\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435 \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u043e\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0441\u043d\u043e \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438\u0442\u0435, \u043a\u043e\u0438\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0437\u043f\u043e\u043b\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0435, \u0438 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0430\u0442\u0430, \u043c\u043e\u043b\u044f, \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0433\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e-\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0443, \u043a\u0430\u043a\u0442\u043e \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0448\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0430 \u0437\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442.","intTextVersion":277501},{"strLang":"CS","strType":"txt","strText":"Pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1me soubory cookie a podobn\u00e9 technologie ke zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f a \u00fadaj\u016f o za\u0159\u00edzen\u00edch pro \u00fa\u010dely, jako je funk\u010dnost webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nek, analytika, personalizace a reklama. Nepodstatn\u00e9 soubory cookie m\u016f\u017eete kdykoli p\u0159ijmout nebo odm\u00edtnout a spravovat sv\u00e9 preference. Dal\u0161\u00ed informace o technologi\u00edch, kter\u00e9 pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1me, a \u00fa\u010delech zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed naleznete v n\u00ed\u017ee uveden\u00fdch podrobn\u00fdch nastaven\u00edch a tak\u00e9 v na\u0161ich z\u00e1sad\u00e1ch ochrany osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f.","intTextVersion":277515},{"strLang":"DA","strType":"txt","strText":"Vi bruger cookies og lignende teknologier til at behandle personoplysninger og enhedsoplysninger til form\u00e5l som f.eks. hjemmesidefunktionalitet, analyser, personalisering og annoncering. Du kan til enhver tid acceptere eller afvise ikke-essentielle cookies og administrere dine pr\u00e6ferencer. For mere information om de teknologier, vi bruger, og form\u00e5lene med behandlingen, bedes du gennemg\u00e5 de detaljerede indstillinger nedenfor samt vores privatlivspolitik.","intTextVersion":277528},{"strLang":"EL","strType":"txt","strText":"\u03a7\u03c1\u03b7\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03b9\u03bf\u03cd\u03bc\u03b5 cookies \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03cc\u03bc\u03bf\u03b9\u03b5\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03b3\u03af\u03b5\u03c2 \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03b5\u03c0\u03b5\u03be\u03b5\u03c1\u03b3\u03b1\u03c3\u03af\u03b1 \u03c0\u03c1\u03bf\u03c3\u03c9\u03c0\u03b9\u03ba\u03ce\u03bd \u03b4\u03b5\u03b4\u03bf\u03bc\u03ad\u03bd\u03c9\u03bd \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b4\u03b5\u03b4\u03bf\u03bc\u03ad\u03bd\u03c9\u03bd \u03c3\u03c5\u03c3\u03ba\u03b5\u03c5\u03ce\u03bd \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c3\u03ba\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2 \u03cc\u03c0\u03c9\u03c2 \u03b7 \u03bb\u03b5\u03b9\u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c1\u03b3\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc\u03c4\u03b7\u03c4\u03b1 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03cc\u03c4\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03c5, \u03b7 \u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03bb\u03c5\u03c3\u03b7, \u03b7 \u03b5\u03be\u03b1\u03c4\u03bf\u03bc\u03af\u03ba\u03b5\u03c5\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b7 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03c6\u03ae\u03bc\u03b9\u03c3\u03b7. \u039c\u03c0\u03bf\u03c1\u03b5\u03af\u03c4\u03b5 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03b1\u03c0\u03bf\u03b4\u03b5\u03c7\u03c4\u03b5\u03af\u03c4\u03b5 \u03ae \u03bd\u03b1 \u03b1\u03c0\u03bf\u03c1\u03c1\u03af\u03c8\u03b5\u03c4\u03b5 \u03bc\u03b7 \u03b1\u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03c4\u03b1 cookies \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03c7\u03b5\u03b9\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03b5\u03af\u03c4\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c0\u03c1\u03bf\u03c4\u03b9\u03bc\u03ae\u03c3\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c3\u03b1\u03c2 \u03b1\u03bd\u03ac \u03c0\u03ac\u03c3\u03b1 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03b3\u03bc\u03ae. \u0393\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c0\u03b5\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c3\u03cc\u03c4\u03b5\u03c1\u03b5\u03c2 \u03c0\u03bb\u03b7\u03c1\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b5\u03c2 \u03c3\u03c7\u03b5\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ac \u03bc\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03b3\u03af\u03b5\u03c2 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c7\u03c1\u03b7\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03b9\u03bf\u03cd\u03bc\u03b5 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03c3\u03ba\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b5\u03be\u03b5\u03c1\u03b3\u03b1\u03c3\u03af\u03b1\u03c2, \u03b1\u03bd\u03b1\u03c4\u03c1\u03ad\u03be\u03c4\u03b5 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03c2 \u03bb\u03b5\u03c0\u03c4\u03bf\u03bc\u03b5\u03c1\u03b5\u03af\u03c2 \u03c1\u03c5\u03b8\u03bc\u03af\u03c3\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03ac\u03c4\u03c9, \u03ba\u03b1\u03b8\u03ce\u03c2 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c0\u03bf\u03bb\u03b9\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03b1\u03c0\u03bf\u03c1\u03c1\u03ae\u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03bc\u03b1\u03c2.","intTextVersion":277502},{"strLang":"ET","strType":"txt","strText":"Kasutame k\u00fcpsiseid ja sarnaseid tehnoloogiaid isiku- ja seadmeandmete t\u00f6\u00f6tlemiseks sellistel eesm\u00e4rkidel nagu veebisaidi funktsionaalsus, anal\u00fc\u00fcs, isikup\u00e4rastamine ja reklaam. Teil on igal ajal v\u00f5imalik mittevajalikke k\u00fcpsiseid vastu v\u00f5tta v\u00f5i tagasi l\u00fckata ja oma eelistusi hallata. Lisateavet meie kasutatavate tehnoloogiate ja t\u00f6\u00f6tlemise eesm\u00e4rkide kohta leiate allpool olevatest \u00fcksikasjalikest s\u00e4tetest ja meie privaatsuspoliitikast.","intTextVersion":277529},{"strLang":"FI","strType":"txt","strText":"K\u00e4yt\u00e4mme ev\u00e4steit\u00e4 ja vastaavia tekniikoita henkil\u00f6- ja laitetietojen k\u00e4sittelyyn esimerkiksi verkkosivuston toiminnallisuuden, analytiikan, personoinnin ja mainonnan parantamiseksi. Voit hyv\u00e4ksy\u00e4 tai hyl\u00e4t\u00e4 ei-v\u00e4ltt\u00e4m\u00e4tt\u00f6m\u00e4t ev\u00e4steet ja hallita asetuksiasi milloin tahansa. Lis\u00e4tietoja k\u00e4ytt\u00e4mist\u00e4mme tekniikoista ja k\u00e4sittelyn tarkoituksista on alla olevissa yksityiskohtaisissa asetuksissa sek\u00e4 tietosuojak\u00e4yt\u00e4nn\u00f6ss\u00e4mme.","intTextVersion":277530},{"strLang":"GA","strType":"txt","strText":"\u00das\u00e1idimid fian\u00e1in agus teicneola\u00edochta\u00ed comhchos\u00fala chun sonra\u00ed pearsanta agus sonra\u00ed gl\u00e9asanna a phr\u00f3ise\u00e1il chun cr\u00edocha amhail feidhmi\u00falacht l\u00e1ithre\u00e1n gr\u00e9as\u00e1in, anail\u00eds\u00edocht, pearsant\u00fa agus f\u00f3gra\u00edocht. Is f\u00e9idir leat fian\u00e1in neamhriachtanacha a ghlacadh n\u00f3 a dhi\u00falt\u00fa agus do chuid sainroghanna a bhainisti\u00fa tr\u00e1th ar bith. Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais faoi na teicneola\u00edochta\u00ed a \u00fas\u00e1idimid agus cr\u00edocha na pr\u00f3ise\u00e1la, f\u00e9ach ar na socruithe mionsonraithe th\u00edos chomh maith len\u00e1r mbeartas pr\u00edobh\u00e1ideachta.","intTextVersion":277503},{"strLang":"HR","strType":"txt","strText":"Kola\u010di\u0107e i sli\u010dne tehnologije koristimo za obradu osobnih podataka i podataka o ure\u0111ajima u svrhe kao \u0161to su funkcionalnost web stranice, analitika, personalizacija i ogla\u0161avanje. Kola\u010di\u0107e koji nisu neophodni mo\u017eete prihvatiti ili odbiti te u bilo kojem trenutku upravljati svojim postavkama. Za vi\u0161e informacija o tehnologijama koje koristimo i svrhama obrade, pregledajte detaljne postavke u nastavku, kao i na\u0161u politiku privatnosti.","intTextVersion":277516},{"strLang":"HU","strType":"txt","strText":"S\u00fctiket \u00e9s hasonl\u00f3 technol\u00f3gi\u00e1kat haszn\u00e1lunk szem\u00e9lyes \u00e9s eszk\u00f6zadatok feldolgoz\u00e1s\u00e1ra olyan c\u00e9lokra, mint a weboldal m\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9se, elemz\u00e9s, szem\u00e9lyre szab\u00e1s \u00e9s hirdet\u00e9sek. A nem l\u00e9tfontoss\u00e1g\u00fa s\u00fctiket b\u00e1rmikor elfogadhatja vagy elutas\u00edthatja, \u00e9s kezelheti a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sait. Az \u00e1ltalunk haszn\u00e1lt technol\u00f3gi\u00e1kkal \u00e9s a feldolgoz\u00e1s c\u00e9ljaival kapcsolatos tov\u00e1bbi inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k\u00e9rt k\u00e9rj\u00fck, tekintse \u00e1t az al\u00e1bbi r\u00e9szletes be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat, valamint adatv\u00e9delmi ir\u00e1nyelveinket.","intTextVersion":277531},{"strLang":"LT","strType":"txt","strText":"Mes naudojame slapukus ir pana\u0161ias technologijas asmens ir \u012frenginio duomenims tvarkyti tokiais tikslais kaip svetain\u0117s funkcionalumas, analiz\u0117, suasmeninimas ir reklama. J\u016bs galite bet kada sutikti arba atmesti neb\u016btinus slapukus ir tvarkyti savo nuostatas. Nor\u0117dami gauti daugiau informacijos apie m\u016bs\u0173 naudojamas technologijas ir tvarkymo tikslus, per\u017ei\u016br\u0117kite toliau pateiktus i\u0161samius nustatymus ir m\u016bs\u0173 privatumo politik\u0105.","intTextVersion":277504},{"strLang":"LV","strType":"txt","strText":"M\u0113s izmantojam s\u012bkfailus un l\u012bdz\u012bgas tehnolo\u0123ijas, lai apstr\u0101d\u0101tu personas un ier\u012bces datus t\u0101diem m\u0113r\u0137iem k\u0101 t\u012bmek\u013ca vietnes funkcionalit\u0101te, anal\u012btika, personaliz\u0101cija un rekl\u0101ma. J\u016bs jebkur\u0101 laik\u0101 varat pie\u0146emt vai noraid\u012bt neb\u016btiskus s\u012bkfailus un p\u0101rvald\u012bt savas preferences. Lai ieg\u016btu pla\u0161\u0101ku inform\u0101ciju par m\u016bsu izmantotaj\u0101m tehnolo\u0123ij\u0101m un apstr\u0101des m\u0113r\u0137iem, l\u016bdzu, p\u0101rskatiet t\u0101l\u0101k sniegtos detaliz\u0113tos iestat\u012bjumus, k\u0101 ar\u012b m\u016bsu priv\u0101tuma politiku.","intTextVersion":277517},{"strLang":"MT","strType":"txt","strText":"A\u0127na nu\u017caw cookies u teknolo\u0121iji simili biex nippro\u010bessaw dejta personali u tal-apparat g\u0127al skopijiet b\u0127all-funzjonalit\u00e0 tal-websajt, l-analitika, il-personalizzazzjoni, u r-reklamar. Tista&#39; ta\u010b\u010betta jew tirrifjuta cookies mhux essenzjali u timmani\u0121\u0121ja l-preferenzi tieg\u0127ek fi kwalunkwe \u0127in. G\u0127al aktar informazzjoni dwar it-teknolo\u0121iji li nu\u017caw u l-iskopijiet tal-ippro\u010bessar, jekk jog\u0127\u0121bok irrevedi s-settings dettaljati hawn ta\u0127t kif ukoll il-politika ta&#39; privatezza tag\u0127na.","intTextVersion":277532},{"strLang":"NL","strType":"txt","strText":"We gebruiken cookies en vergelijkbare technologie\u00ebn om persoonlijke en apparaatgegevens te verwerken voor doeleinden zoals websitefunctionaliteit, analyses, personalisatie en reclame. U kunt niet-essenti\u00eble cookies accepteren of weigeren en uw voorkeuren op elk gewenst moment beheren. Voor meer informatie over de technologie\u00ebn die we gebruiken en de doeleinden van de verwerking, kunt u de gedetailleerde instellingen hieronder en ons privacybeleid raadplegen.","intTextVersion":277505},{"strLang":"NO","strType":"txt","strText":"Vi bruker informasjonskapsler og lignende teknologier for \u00e5 behandle personopplysninger og enhetsdata for form\u00e5l som nettstedsfunksjonalitet, analyse, personalisering og annonsering. Du kan godta eller avvise un\u00f8dvendige informasjonskapsler og administrere preferansene dine n\u00e5r som helst. Hvis du vil ha mer informasjon om teknologiene vi bruker og form\u00e5lene med behandlingen, kan du se de detaljerte innstillingene nedenfor samt v\u00e5r personvernerkl\u00e6ring.","intTextVersion":277518},{"strLang":"PL","strType":"txt","strText":"U\u017cywamy plik\u00f3w cookie i podobnych technologii do przetwarzania danych osobowych i danych urz\u0105dze\u0144 w celach takich jak funkcjonalno\u015b\u0107 witryny, analityka, personalizacja i reklamy. Mo\u017cesz w dowolnym momencie zaakceptowa\u0107 lub odrzuci\u0107 pliki cookie, kt\u00f3re nie s\u0105 niezb\u0119dne, i zarz\u0105dza\u0107 swoimi preferencjami. Aby uzyska\u0107 wi\u0119cej informacji o wykorzystywanych przez nas technologiach i celach przetwarzania, zapoznaj si\u0119 ze szczeg\u00f3\u0142owymi ustawieniami poni\u017cej oraz z nasz\u0105 polityk\u0105 prywatno\u015bci.","intTextVersion":277533},{"strLang":"PT","strType":"txt","strText":"Utilizamos cookies e tecnologias semelhantes para processar dados pessoais e de dispositivos para fins como funcionalidades do site, an\u00e1lises, personaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e publicidade. Voc\u00ea pode aceitar ou rejeitar cookies n\u00e3o essenciais e gerenciar suas prefer\u00eancias a qualquer momento. Para obter mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es sobre as tecnologias que utilizamos e as finalidades do processamento, consulte as configura\u00e7\u00f5es detalhadas abaixo, bem como nossa pol\u00edtica de privacidade.","intTextVersion":277506},{"strLang":"RO","strType":"txt","strText":"Folosim cookie-uri \u0219i tehnologii similare pentru a prelucra date cu caracter personal \u0219i date despre dispozitive \u00een scopuri precum func\u021bionalitatea site-ului web, analiz\u0103, personalizare \u0219i publicitate. Pute\u021bi accepta sau respinge cookie-uri neesen\u021biale \u0219i v\u0103 pute\u021bi gestiona preferin\u021bele \u00een orice moment. Pentru mai multe informa\u021bii despre tehnologiile pe care le folosim \u0219i scopurile prelucr\u0103rii, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 consulta\u021bi set\u0103rile detaliate de mai jos, precum \u0219i politica noastr\u0103 de confiden\u021bialitate.","intTextVersion":277519},{"strLang":"SK","strType":"txt","strText":"Na spracovanie osobn\u00fdch \u00fadajov a \u00fadajov zo zariaden\u00ed pou\u017e\u00edvame s\u00fabory cookie a podobn\u00e9 technol\u00f3gie na \u00fa\u010dely, ako s\u00fa funk\u010dnos\u0165 webov\u00fdch str\u00e1nok, analytika, personaliz\u00e1cia a reklama. Nepodstatn\u00e9 s\u00fabory cookie m\u00f4\u017eete kedyko\u013evek prija\u0165 alebo odmietnu\u0165 a spravova\u0165 svoje preferencie. Viac inform\u00e1ci\u00ed o technol\u00f3gi\u00e1ch, ktor\u00e9 pou\u017e\u00edvame, a \u00fa\u010deloch spracovania n\u00e1jdete v podrobn\u00fdch nastaveniach ni\u017e\u0161ie, ako aj v na\u0161ich z\u00e1sad\u00e1ch ochrany osobn\u00fdch \u00fadajov.","intTextVersion":277534},{"strLang":"SL","strType":"txt","strText":"Za obdelavo osebnih podatkov in podatkov o napravah uporabljamo pi\u0161kotke in podobne tehnologije za namene, kot so delovanje spletnega mesta, analitika, personalizacija in ogla\u0161evanje. Nebistvene pi\u0161kotke lahko kadar koli sprejmete ali zavrnete ter upravljate svoje nastavitve. Za ve\u010d informacij o tehnologijah, ki jih uporabljamo, in namenih obdelave si oglejte spodnje podrobne nastavitve in na\u0161o politiko zasebnosti.","intTextVersion":277507},{"strLang":"RU","strType":"txt","strText":"\u041c\u044b \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u0435\u043c \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u044b cookie \u0438 \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0438 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043e\u0431 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u0445 \u0432 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u044f\u0445, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043e\u0431\u0435\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0432\u0435\u0431-\u0441\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0430, \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0430, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0440\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0430. \u0412\u044b \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0432 \u043b\u044e\u0431\u043e\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u044f\u0442\u044c \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0442\u043a\u043b\u043e\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u044f\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u044b cookie \u0438 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u043c\u0438. \u0414\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0434\u043e\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438 \u043e\u0431 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u0435\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u043d\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u044f\u0445 \u0438 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u044f\u0445 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438, \u043f\u043e\u0436\u0430\u043b\u0443\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0430, \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043c\u044c\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u0435, \u0430 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0436\u0435 \u0441 \u043d\u0430\u0448\u0435\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438.","intTextVersion":277520},{"strLang":"UK","strType":"txt","strText":"\u041c\u0438 \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u0438 cookie \u0442\u0430 \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0456\u0447\u043d\u0456 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0456\u0457 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043e\u0431\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u0456 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0457\u0432 \u0437 \u043c\u0435\u0442\u043e\u044e \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0456\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456 \u0432\u0435\u0431-\u0441\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0443, \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0456\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0438, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0456\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0457 \u0442\u0430 \u0440\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0438. \u0412\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u044c-\u043a\u043e\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0439\u043d\u044f\u0442\u0438 \u0430\u0431\u043e \u0432\u0456\u0434\u0445\u0438\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0432\u2019\u044f\u0437\u043a\u043e\u0432\u0456 \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u0438 cookie \u0442\u0430 \u043a\u0435\u0440\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0457\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c\u0438. \u0429\u043e\u0431 \u043e\u0442\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0434\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434\u043d\u0456\u0448\u0443 \u0456\u043d\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0446\u0456\u044e \u043f\u0440\u043e \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0456\u0457, \u044f\u043a\u0456 \u043c\u0438 \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e, \u0442\u0430 \u0446\u0456\u043b\u0456 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043a\u0438, \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0439\u043e\u043c\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044f \u0437 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u0447\u0435, \u0430 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0436 \u0437 \u043d\u0430\u0448\u043e\u044e \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0456\u0442\u0438\u043a\u043e\u044e \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0456\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0446\u0456\u0439\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456.","intTextVersion":277535},{"strLang":"TR","strType":"txt","strText":"Web sitesi i\u015flevselli\u011fi, analiz, ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirme ve reklamc\u0131l\u0131k gibi ama\u00e7larla ki\u015fisel ve cihaz verilerini i\u015flemek i\u00e7in \u00e7erezler ve benzer teknolojiler kullan\u0131yoruz. Gerekli olmayan \u00e7erezleri kabul edebilir veya reddedebilir ve tercihlerinizi istedi\u011finiz zaman y\u00f6netebilirsiniz. Kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z teknolojiler ve i\u015fleme ama\u00e7lar\u0131 hakk\u0131nda daha fazla bilgi i\u00e7in l\u00fctfen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 ayarlara ve gizlilik politikam\u0131za g\u00f6z at\u0131n.","intTextVersion":277508},{"strLang":"ZH","strType":"txt","strText":"\u6211\u4eec\u4f7f\u7528 Cookie \u548c\u7c7b\u4f3c\u6280\u672f\u6765\u5904\u7406\u4e2a\u4eba\u548c\u8bbe\u5907\u6570\u636e\uff0c\u7528\u4e8e\u7f51\u7ad9\u529f\u80fd\u3001\u5206\u6790\u3001\u4e2a\u6027\u5316\u548c\u5e7f\u544a\u7b49\u7528\u9014\u3002\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u968f\u65f6\u63a5\u53d7\u6216\u62d2\u7edd\u975e\u5fc5\u8981\u7684 Cookie \u5e76\u7ba1\u7406\u60a8\u7684\u504f\u597d\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3002\u5982\u9700\u4e86\u89e3\u66f4\u591a\u5173\u4e8e\u6211\u4eec\u4f7f\u7528\u7684\u6280\u672f\u53ca\u5176\u5904\u7406\u76ee\u7684\u7684\u4fe1\u606f\uff0c\u8bf7\u67e5\u770b\u4e0b\u65b9\u7684\u8be6\u7ec6\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4ee5\u53ca\u6211\u4eec\u7684\u9690\u79c1\u653f\u7b56\u3002","intTextVersion":277521},{"strLang":"SR","strType":"txt","strText":"\u041a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043c\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0438\u045b\u0435 \u0438 \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0458\u0435 \u0437\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0434\u0443 \u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0438\u0445 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430\u043a\u0430 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430\u043a\u0430 \u043e \u0443\u0440\u0435\u0452\u0430\u0458\u0438\u043c\u0430 \u0443 \u0441\u0432\u0440\u0445\u0435 \u043a\u0430\u043e \u0448\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0443 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442 \u0432\u0435\u0431 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0435, \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0430, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0458\u0430 \u0438 \u043e\u0433\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0430\u0432\u0430\u045a\u0435. \u041c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0445\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0434\u0431\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0431\u0438\u0442\u043d\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0438\u045b\u0435 \u0438 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0459\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0458\u0438\u043c \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0432\u0430\u045a\u0438\u043c\u0430 \u0443 \u0431\u0438\u043b\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043c \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0443\u0442\u043a\u0443. \u0417\u0430 \u0432\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0458\u0430 \u043e \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0458\u0430\u043c\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0458\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043c\u043e \u0438 \u0441\u0432\u0440\u0445\u0430\u043c\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0434\u0435, \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0433\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0458\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0459\u043d\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0432\u0430\u045a\u0430 \u0443 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043a\u0443, \u043a\u0430\u043e \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0448\u0443 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0443 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438.","intTextVersion":277536},{"strLang":"AR","strType":"txt","strText":"\u0646\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645 \u0645\u0644\u0641\u0627\u062a \u062a\u0639\u0631\u064a\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0627\u0637 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0642\u0646\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0627\u0628\u0647\u0629 \u0644\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0644\u062c\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062c\u0647\u0632\u0629 \u0644\u0623\u063a\u0631\u0627\u0636\u064d \u0645\u062b\u0644 \u062a\u062d\u0633\u064a\u0646 \u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0642\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0644\u0643\u062a\u0631\u0648\u0646\u064a\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0644\u064a\u0644\u0627\u062a\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0635\u060c \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0625\u0639\u0644\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a. \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0643 \u0642\u0628\u0648\u0644 \u0623\u0648 \u0631\u0641\u0636 \u0645\u0644\u0641\u0627\u062a \u062a\u0639\u0631\u064a\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0627\u0637 \u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0636\u0631\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u0625\u062f\u0627\u0631\u0629 \u062a\u0641\u0636\u064a\u0644\u0627\u062a\u0643 \u0641\u064a \u0623\u064a \u0648\u0642\u062a. \u0644\u0645\u0632\u064a\u062f \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0644\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a \u062d\u0648\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0642\u0646\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u0646\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0647\u0627 \u0648\u0623\u063a\u0631\u0627\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0644\u062c\u0629\u060c \u064a\u064f\u0631\u062c\u0649 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0641\u0635\u064a\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u062f\u0646\u0627\u0647 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0625\u0636\u0627\u0641\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0633\u064a\u0627\u0633\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0635\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0646\u0627.","intTextVersion":277509},{"strLang":"BS","strType":"txt","strText":"Koristimo kola\u010di\u0107e i sli\u010dne tehnologije za obradu li\u010dnih podataka i podataka o ure\u0111ajima u svrhe kao \u0161to su funkcionalnost web stranice, analitika, personalizacija i ogla\u0161avanje. Mo\u017eete prihvatiti ili odbiti neesencijalne kola\u010di\u0107e i upravljati svojim postavkama u bilo kojem trenutku. Za vi\u0161e informacija o tehnologijama koje koristimo i svrhama obrade, molimo vas da pregledate detaljne postavke u nastavku, kao i na\u0161u politiku privatnosti.","intTextVersion":277522},{"strLang":"JA","strType":"txt","strText":"\u5f53\u793e\u306f\u3001\u30a6\u30a7\u30d6\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u3001\u5206\u6790\u3001\u30d1\u30fc\u30bd\u30ca\u30e9\u30a4\u30ba\u3001\u5e83\u544a\u306a\u3069\u306e\u76ee\u7684\u3067\u3001Cookie\u304a\u3088\u3073\u985e\u4f3c\u6280\u8853\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u500b\u4eba\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3068\u30c7\u30d0\u30a4\u30b9\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u51e6\u7406\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5fc5\u9808\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044Cookie\u306f\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u53d7\u3051\u5165\u308c\u307e\u305f\u306f\u62d2\u5426\u3067\u304d\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u7ba1\u7406\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f53\u793e\u304c\u4f7f\u7528\u3059\u308b\u6280\u8853\u3068\u51e6\u7406\u76ee\u7684\u306e\u8a73\u7d30\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306f\u3001\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u8a73\u7d30\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3068\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30b7\u30fc\u30dd\u30ea\u30b7\u30fc\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002","intTextVersion":277537},{"strLang":"CY","strType":"txt","strText":"Rydym yn defnyddio cwcis a thechnolegau tebyg i brosesu data personol a data dyfeisiau at ddibenion megis ymarferoldeb gwefannau, dadansoddeg, personoli a hysbysebu. Gallwch dderbyn neu wrthod cwcis nad ydynt yn hanfodol a rheoli eich dewisiadau ar unrhyw adeg. I gael rhagor o wybodaeth am y technolegau a ddefnyddiwn a dibenion prosesu, adolygwch y gosodiadau manwl isod yn ogystal \u00e2&#39;n polisi preifatrwydd.","intTextVersion":277510},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99875},{"strLang":"ES","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99876},{"strLang":"FR","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99877},{"strLang":"IT","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99878},{"strLang":"SV","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99879},{"strLang":"BG","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99880},{"strLang":"CS","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99881},{"strLang":"DA","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99882},{"strLang":"EL","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99883},{"strLang":"ET","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99884},{"strLang":"FI","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99885},{"strLang":"GA","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99886},{"strLang":"HR","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99887},{"strLang":"HU","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99888},{"strLang":"LT","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99889},{"strLang":"LV","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99890},{"strLang":"MT","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99891},{"strLang":"NL","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99892},{"strLang":"NO","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99893},{"strLang":"PL","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99894},{"strLang":"PT","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99895},{"strLang":"RO","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99896},{"strLang":"SK","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99897},{"strLang":"SL","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99898},{"strLang":"RU","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99899},{"strLang":"UK","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99900},{"strLang":"TR","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99901},{"strLang":"ZH","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99902},{"strLang":"SR","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99903},{"strLang":"AR","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99904},{"strLang":"BS","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99905},{"strLang":"JA","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99906},{"strLang":"CY","strType":"hl","strText":" ","intTextVersion":99907},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cc","strText":"en"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl","strText":"Consent to Cookies & Data processing"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt","strText":"On this website we use cookies and similar functions to process end device information and personal data (e.g. such as IP-addresses or browser information). The processing is used for purposes such as to integrate content, external services and elements from third parties, statistical analysis\/measurement, personalized advertising and the integration of social media. Depending on the function, data is passed on to up to [link=vendors][vendorcount] third parties[\/link] and processed by them. This consent is voluntary, not required for the use of our website and can be revoked at any time using the icon on the bottom left."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"litxt","strText":"Please note that some vendors will process personal data based on legitimate interest. You have the right to object to this processing. In order to do this, please click on \"Custom settings\" and disable the vendors."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"storagetxt","strText":"The choices you make regarding the purposes and entities listed in this notice are saved in a cookie named [tcfcookiename] for a maximum duration of [tcfcookieduration] days."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_reconsent","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_reconsent","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_att","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_custom","strText":"Customize your choice"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_custom","strText":"On this page you can find more information about purposes of data processing and the vendors that we use on our websites."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_yes","strText":"Accept all"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_no","strText":"Reject all"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_accept","strText":"Accept"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_reject","strText":"Reject"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_save","strText":"Save + Exit"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_yes2","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_no2","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_save2","strText":""},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_continue","strText":"Continue without acceptance"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_settings","strText":"Settings"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_ccpaok","strText":"Okay"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_ccpaooall","strText":"Opt out of all"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_ccpasaveselection","strText":"Save selection"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_ccpaallowall","strText":"Allow all"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_custom","strText":"Customize your choice"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_more","strText":"Privacy notice"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_back","strText":"Back to main page"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookies","strText":"Cookies"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_tac","strText":"T&C"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_imprint","strText":"Legal notice"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"ccpadns","strText":"Do Not Sell My Personal Information"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"savepref","strText":"remember my choice (sets cookies)"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_cookies","strText":"Cookies"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_cookies","strText":"On our website we and our partners may set the following cookies:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookiename","strText":"Cookie name"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookiesample","strText":"Sample value"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"expire","strText":"Expire"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"domain","strText":"Domain"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype","strText":"Type"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_0","strText":"[unknown]"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_1","strText":"Function"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_2","strText":"Marketing"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_3","strText":"Preferences"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_4","strText":"Measurement"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_5","strText":"Other"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookietype_6","strText":"Social media"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookieinfo_hl","strText":"Manage your cookies"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cookieinfo_text","strText":"<p>There are various ways to manage cookie related preferences and to provide and withdraw consent, where relevant:<\/p>\r\n<p>Users can manage preferences related to cookies from directly within their own device settings, for example, by preventing the use or storage of cookies.<\/p>\r\n<p>Additionally, whenever the use of cookies is based on consent, Users can provide or withdraw such consent by setting their preferences within the cookie notice or by updating such preferences accordingly via the relevant consent-preferences widget, if available.<\/p>\r\n<p>It is also possible, via relevant browser or device features, to delete previously stored cookies, including those used to remember the User\u2019s initial consent.<\/p>\r\n<p>Other cookies in the browser\u2019s local memory may be cleared by deleting the browsing history.<\/p>\r\n<p>With regard to any third-party cookies, Users can manage their preferences and withdraw their consent via the related opt-out link (where provided), by using the means indicated in the third party\u2019s privacy policy, or by contacting the third party.<\/p>\r\n<h4>Locating Cookie Settings<\/h4>\r\n<p>Users can, for example, find information about how to manage Cookies in the most commonly used browsers at the following addresses:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/support.google.com\/chrome\/answer\/95647?hl=en&amp;p=cpn_cookies\">Google Chrome<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/support.mozilla.org\/en-US\/kb\/enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences\">Mozilla Firefox<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/support.apple.com\/guide\/safari\/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471\/\">Apple Safari<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http:\/\/windows.microsoft.com\/en-us\/windows-vista\/block-or-allow-cookies\">Microsoft Internet Explorer<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/support.microsoft.com\/en-us\/help\/4027947\">Microsoft Edge<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/support.brave.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360022806212-How-do-I-use-Shields-while-browsing\">Brave<\/a><\/li>\r\n  <li><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/help.opera.com\/en\/latest\/web-preferences\/#cookies\">Opera<\/a><\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p>Users may also manage certain categories of cookies used on mobile apps by opting out through relevant device settings such as the device advertising settings for mobile devices, or cookie settings in general (Users may open the device settings and look for the relevant setting).<\/p>\r\n<h4>How to opt out of interest-based advertising<\/h4>\r\n<p>Notwithstanding the above, Users may follow the instructions provided by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/www.youronlinechoices.eu\/\">YourOnlineChoices<\/a> (EU), the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/thenai.org\/about-online-advertising\/\">Network Advertising Initiative<\/a> (US) and the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/www.aboutads.info\/consumers\/\">Digital Advertising Alliance<\/a> (US), <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/youradchoices.ca\/understanding-online-advertising\/\">DAAC<\/a> (Canada), <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http:\/\/www.ddai.info\/optout\">DDAI<\/a> (Japan) or other similar services. Such initiatives allow Users to select their cookie preferences for most of the advertising tools. The Owner thus recommends that Users make use of these resources in addition to the information provided in this document.\r\n<\/p><p>The Digital Advertising Alliance offers an application called <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https:\/\/youradchoices.com\/appchoices\">AppChoices<\/a> that helps Users to control interest-based advertising on mobile apps.<\/p>\r\n<h4>Consequences of denying consent<\/h4>\r\n<p>Users are free to decide whether or not to grant consent. However, please note that cookies help this Website to provide a better experience and advanced functionalities to Users (in line with the purposes outlined in this document). Therefore, in the absence of the User\u2019s consent, the Owner may be unable to provide related features.<\/p>"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendorinfo_company","strText":"Company, that processes the data"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendorinfo_cookies","strText":"Cookies, set in your browser"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendorinfo_legal","strText":"Legal basis, for data processing"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendorinfo_purposes","strText":"Purposes, for data processing"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"subservices","strText":"Subservices"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txtsubservices","strText":"When enabling this vendor, other vendors will also be enabled. These are:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"show_vendors","strText":"Show vendors"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_datacontroller","strText":"Data controller"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_controllertext","strText":"The data controller (GDPR Art 4.7) is the following company:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_tel","strText":"Telephone"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_mail","strText":"eMail"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_website","strText":"Website"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_dpo","strText":"Data protection officer"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"companyinfo_dpotext","strText":"Our data protection officer can be reached as follows:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_preview","strText":"We need your approval"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_preview","strText":"This content is provided by [vendorname]. By enabling this content, your personal data may be processed by the vendor and cookies may be set."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"btn_preview","strText":"Accept"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cb_preview","strText":"Always accept [vendorname]"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"purpose","strText":"Purpose"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendor","strText":"Vendor"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"vendors","strText":"Vendors"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"unknown_vendor","strText":"unknown vendor"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"all_purposes","strText":"All Purposes"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"all_vendors","strText":"All Vendors"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"special_purposes","strText":"Special Purposes"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"special_features","strText":"Special Features"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"on","strText":"On"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"off","strText":"Off"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"always_on","strText":"Always on"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"year","strText":"Year"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"month","strText":"Month"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"day","strText":"Day"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"age","strText":"Age"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"recallbtn","strText":"Privacy settings"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"load","strText":"Loading"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"close","strText":"Close"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"your_choice","strText":"Your choice"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"consent","strText":"Consent"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"legint","strText":"Legitimate Interest"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"legintdescr","strText":"For some purposes and\/or vendors we use the legal basis \"Legitimate Interest\" (GDPR 6.1.f)."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"noneu","strText":"Non-EU datatransfers"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"noneudescr","strText":"Some vendors may transfer, store or process your personal data outside of the EEA\/EU. These countries may not have the same data protection niveau and enforcement of your rights might be limited or not possible."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"noneudescr2","strText":"This vendor may transfer, store or process your personal data outside of the EEA\/EU. These countries may not have the same data protection niveau and enforcement of your rights might be limited or not possible."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"features","strText":"Features"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"privacypolicy","strText":"Privacy policy"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"description","strText":"Description"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"language","strText":"Language"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"txt_qr","strText":"You can scan the following QR code with your mobile phone in order to see the content on your phone. Otherwise you can click on the link below in order to access it directly."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"this_website_app","strText":"this website\/app"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"designurl_pcp","strText":"https:\/\/..."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"designurl_imprint","strText":"https:\/\/..."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"designurl_tac","strText":"https:\/\/..."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_welcometext","strText":"Visit this website as usual with advertising and tracking. You can revoke your consent at any time via the privacy policy."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_welcomesubtext","strText":"More Info on advertising and tracking can be found in our [link=privacy]privacy policy[\/link] or in our [link=settings]privacy center[\/link]."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_welcomeheadline","strText":"... or with contentpass"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_welcomepasstext","strText":"Visit this website completely free of advertising, personalized tracking and commercials from [cp_price] [cp_currency_html] \/ month."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_already_signedup","strText":"Already contentpass member?"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_btntxt","strText":"Ad-free for [cp_price] [cp_currency_html] \/ month"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"cp_login","strText":"Login"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"welect_welcomeheadline","strText":"... or watch a promotional video"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"welect_welcomepasstext","strText":"Watch a promotional video and get free access to this website for [welect_minutes] minutes without personalized ads or tracking."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"welect_btntxt","strText":"Choose a video"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices","strText":"AdChoices"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices_adjust_url","strText":"Adjust Ad Preferences Across the Web"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices_about_url","strText":"Learn more about AdChoices"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices_headline","strText":"About Our Ads"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices_subtext","strText":"Data collected from your browser or app is used to improve your ad experiences and our services."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"adchoices_descr","strText":"Do you want to opt out of interest-based advertising, or would you like to customize your categories of interest to improve the advertisements you see across the web?"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"gpc_purpose_disabled_label","strText":"Disabled by your browser privacy setting (GPC)"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_dsa_info","strText":"Information about Advertising on this Website"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_dsa_adtxt","strText":"The following ad has used personal data to determine that this ad should be presented to you."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"h2_dsa_why","strText":"Why do I see this Advertising?"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_whytxt","strText":"The following companies where involved in the decision-making process and used personal data in order to determine that this advertising should be presented to you:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_adsbasedon","strText":"The company used the following main parameters to determine to present the ad to you:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_param_1","strText":"Information about your activity, interests, demographic information, or other characteristics. Information may be collected and used across contexts."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_param_2","strText":"Real-time information about the context in which the ad will be shown.  This includes information about the content and your device, such as your device type and capabilities, user agent, URL, IP address, or non-precise geolocation data. Additionally, use of basic cross-context information not based on your behavior or characteristics, for uses such as frequency capping, sequencing, brand safety, anti-fraud."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_param_3","strText":"Precise real-time geolocation of your device, i.e. GPS coordinates within 500 meter radius precision."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"h2_dsa_who","strText":"About the Advertiser"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_behalf","strText":"The advertising is presented on behalf of:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_paidby","strText":"The advertising is paid by:"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"h2_dsa_ad","strText":"About this Advertising"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_adid","strText":"Ad ID"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_url","strText":"URL"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_detailbtn","strText":"Show Details"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_iurl","strText":"Preview"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"h2_dsa_adjust","strText":"Adjust your Advertising preferences"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_adjusttxt","strText":"You can update your advertising preferences at any time by clicking on the icon in the left lower corner of the website."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"dsa_custombtn","strText":"Customize your choices"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_dsa_list","strText":"Advertising on this page"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"hl_dsa_listtxt","strText":"The following ads on this page have used personal data to determine that this ad should be presented to you. Click on the details link in order to see further information."},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_clickpath","strText":"Clickpath"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_financial_information","strText":"Financial information"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_fraud_detectionprevention","strText":"Fraud detection and prevention"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_ip","strText":"IP"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_language","strText":"Language"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_user_location","strText":"Tracking user location"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_offlinedata","strText":"Match and combine with offline data"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_measuring_visibility_of_ads","strText":"Measuring visibility of ads"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_mouse_movement","strText":"Mouse movement"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_timestamp","strText":"Timestamp"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_timezone","strText":"Timezone"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_clicks_on_ads","strText":"Tracking clicks on ads"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_conversion","strText":"Tracking conversion"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_media","strText":"Tracking media"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_time_and_date","strText":"Tracking time and date"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_timezone","strText":"Tracking timezone"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_user_device","strText":"Tracking user device"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_cats_tracking_user_network","strText":"Tracking user network"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_browser_info","strText":"User agent"},{"strLang":"EN","strType":"data_visited_